  destinations:
  - destinationName: Taj Mahal Gardens
    description: 'Symmetrical gardens frame a world-famous monument. Reflecting pools
      mirror elegant marble architecture. Flowerbeds add color throughout the grounds.
      Peaceful pathways invite quiet exploration.

      Timeless beauty defines
      the landscap.'
    background: {fileID: 8331461073583684744, guid: c39c11bca91d3442abd7558d76f79091, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Udaipur Lake Palace
    description: Palaces rise above shimmering lake waters. Historic architecture
      reflects royal heritage. Boats glide peacefully across the lake. Mountain views
      surround the city. Elegance shines from every direction.
    background: {fileID: -8708973283550955558, guid: 66894beb683ad441fb73512e5f09bd96, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Kerala Backwaters
    description: Palm-lined waterways weave through tropical landscapes. Traditional
      boats travel peaceful water routes. Lush greenery flourishes along the shoreline.Village
      life thrives beside the canals. Nature and culture blend beautifully.
    background: {fileID: -7972824873869021455, guid: 9a2fe9ff1e3434c9e89209e73fc74314, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Jaipur Palace Garden
    description: Grand courtyards showcase vibrant royal architecture. Fountains
      and flowers brighten elegant grounds. Historic palaces overlook scenic gardens.Colorful
      details celebrate local craftsmanship. Royal splendor fills every view.
    background: {fileID: -490531667605249457, guid: ff36e9595c72047d091e82e2ecc8c9b8, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Darjeeling Hills
    description: Tea gardens cover rolling mountain slopes. Mist drifts across breathtaking
      landscapes. Narrow pathways wind through green hills. Snow-capped peaks rise
      in the distance. A refreshing mountain escape awaits.
    background: {fileID: -8894272606689853238, guid: e291f25d5792f443a96f6ffc1cc23ded, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Mysore Palace Grounds
    description: "Magnificent palace architecture dominates the skyline. Wide gardens
      surround the historic complex. Colorful flowers enhance every pathway. Rich
      cultural heritage fills the atmosphere. A royal legacy remains beautifully
      preserved.\t\t"
    background: {fileID: -7389314079060344510, guid: f7316d08bbe984b0f9144c93e8611c43, type: 3}
